DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      15      0    101  Mixed  Hail Emperor \x83. The \x81 empire genuinely thanks you for your generous tribute in difficult times.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      16      0    120  Title  Many \x81s have looked to the \x80 empire with great distrust, but your tribute has now won over the conviction of many.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      17      0     86  Title  Your tribute has been accepted as reparations for your crimes against the \x81 empire.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      18      0    151  Title  Diplomatic channels between the \x80 and \x81 empires have been tenuous at best, but your tribute now offers a way to significantly reduce the tension.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      19      0     93  Title  Emperor \x83, the \x81 empire applauds your generous tribute and welcomes future cooperation.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      20      0     78  Title  You have made a wise choice in offering tribute to an obviously superior race.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      21      0     86  Title  The \x81 empire greatly appreciates your support with such a magnanimous contribution.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      22      0     91  Title  Emperor \x83, your generous tribute has laid many \x81 grievances with your empire to rest.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      23      0    134  Title  Emperor \x83, your magnificent contribution will go far toward establishing a lasting peace and a hopeful future for both our peoples.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      24      0     99  Title  With tribute such as this, both our empires will soon be able to exist together in perfect harmony.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      30      0    104  Title  Your contributions to establish mutual trade between our two empires has greatly enhanced our relations.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      31      0     91  Title  The trade between the \x80 and the \x81 empires has greatly relaxed current tension levels.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      32      0    149  Title  Emperor \x83, the trade between our two empires has not only increased our production but has also formed a basis for mutual respect and cooperation.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      33      0    125  Title  The prosperous trade between our two empires has formed a solid financial foundation from which both our empires can benefit.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      34      0    113  Title  Although our empires have had disagreements in the past, mutual trade has certainly relieved some of the tension.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      35      0    134  Title  Continued trade between the \x80 and the \x81 empires is of extreme importance if both our empires are to resist the threat of others.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      36      0     90  Title  The trade you offered has given our two empires an opportunity to strengthen our alliance.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      37      0    145  Title  The prosperous trade between the \x80 and the \x81 empires has provided excellent incentives to maintain a lasting peace between our two empires.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      38      0     91  Title  Our mutual trade has marked a new era of cooperation between the \x80 and the \x81 empires.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      45      0     70  Title  Together our empires can challenge the threat of the evil \x86 empire.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      46      0     80  Title  Your attacks against the insidious \x86 proves the honor in your words of peace.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      47      0    101  Title  Emperor \x83, you to must now realize the incredible threat the \x86 empire poses to both our worlds.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      48      0     78  Title  It would seem that both our empires share a common enemy, the loathsome \x86s.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      49      0    100  Mixed  Obviously the \x86 menace has even reached the \x80 empire. Together we will smite the infidel dogs.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      60      0     94  Mixed  Watch yourself Emperor \x83. We will no longer tolerate espionage attempts against our empire.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      61      0     92  Title  We have known of your espionage operations for quite some time, and our patience wears thin.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      62      0    135  Title  We have had great restraint thus far tolerating your bungling espionage attempts, but soon you shall feel the wrath of the \x81 empire.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      63      0     80  Title  The \x81 empire is compelled to protest your persistent \x84 espionage attempts.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      64      0    144  Mixed  Obviously you have underestimated our patience in dealing with \x84 espionage. If you continue, it will most certainly lead to open hostilities.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      65      0     88  Title  Your \x84 espionage attempts are creating tension between the \x80 and \x81 the empires.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      90      0    161  Title  In the past the \x81 empire has been kind to inferior species, but if you persist in the sabotage of our \x82 we will eliminate the \x80 threat once and for all.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      91      0     96  Mixed  Surely Emperor \x83, you must realize that sabotage will surely jeopardize any future relations.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1      92      0    127  Title  Continued sabotage against our \x82 in the \x85 star system will soon place our empires precariously close to the brink of war.
