DIPLOMAT.LBX      1     484      0    102  Mixed  A cry has rung out through our empire for new colonies. I have no other choice than to break our \x97.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1     495      0    106  Title  We are unwilling to enter into a treaty at this time because you have broken treaties with us in the past.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1     496      0     81  Mixed  You have not honored your past agreements. We see little reason to trust you now.
