DIPLOMAT.LBX      1     498      0     77  Title  We see no reason to agree with someone who has not lived up to past promises.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1     499      0     46  Title  We will not deal with \x80s who have no honor.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1     510      0     76  Title  How can you expect us to accept when your spies are stealing our technology.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1     511      0     37  Title  Remove your spies, then we will talk.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1     512      0     78  Mixed  You thieving dogs, you steal the fruits of our research. We deny your request.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1     513      0    104  Mixed  Our technology is for the \x81 race. You have no right to steal it. We will talk when you stop stealing.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1     514      0     78  Mixed  Why should we give you anything? Your spies already steal everything you need!
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1     540      0     77  Mixed  What! You expect us to agree when you are sabotaging our factories and bases?
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1     541      0     85  Title  When you stop sabotaging our factories and bases, we can consider the matter further.
DIPLOMAT.LBX      1     542      0    122  Mixed  We have not forgotten your last sabotage incident. Until you have proven to be more trustworthy we will not deal with you.
